{"slug":"enterprise-rag-with-local-llms","html":"<h2 id=\"why-private-local-ai-matters\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Why Private Local AI Matters</span><a href=\"#why-private-local-ai-matters\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><p class=\"text-pretty\">In enterprise environments, data privacy and compliance make sending confidential documents to external third-party API providers a non-starter. </p><p class=\"text-pretty\">Building <strong>self-hosted, private RAG pipelines</strong> gives organizations:</p><ul>\n<li><strong>Zero Data Leakage</strong>: Sensitive contracts, internal source code, and banking data never leave your internal perimeter.</li>\n<li><strong>Predictable Cost</strong>: Fixed compute hardware replaces variable, runaway token-based pricing.</li>\n<li><strong>Fine-Grained Latency Control</strong>: Optimized quantized models running directly on dedicated GPU clusters or workstation servers.</li>\n</ul><h2 id=\"pipeline-architecture\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Pipeline Architecture</span><a href=\"#pipeline-architecture\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><p class=\"text-pretty\">A robust RAG system is not just passing prompt strings to an LLM. High-quality answers require a multi-stage retrieval architecture:</p><div class=\"code-block relative my-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm group\">\n<div class=\"code-block-header flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">text</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded transition-colors\" data-code=\"%5BDocument%20Ingestion%5D%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%96%BC%0A%5BSmart%20Chunking%20(Semantic%20%2B%20Overlap)%5D%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%9C%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%90%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%96%BC%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%96%BC%0A%5BDense%20Vector%20Embeddings%5D%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5BSparse%20BM25%20Index%5D%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%94%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%AC%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%94%98%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%96%BC%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5BHybrid%20Search%20%26%20Re-ranking%5D%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%96%BC%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5BContext-Aware%20Local%20LLM%20Inference%5D\" data-i18n-aria=\"copyCode\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span data-copy-label>Copy</span></button>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark shiki-pre\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[Document Ingestion]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Smart Chunking (Semantic + Overlap)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ├─────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ▼                             ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Dense Vector Embeddings]       [Sparse BM25 Index]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        │                             │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        └──────────────┬──────────────┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                       ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              [Hybrid Search &amp; Re-ranking]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                       │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                       ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         [Context-Aware Local LLM Inference]</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><h3 id=\"1-hybrid-retrieval-strategy\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>1. Hybrid Retrieval Strategy</span><a href=\"#1-hybrid-retrieval-strategy\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">Pure dense vector search frequently fails on specific keywords, acronyms, and product identifiers (e.g. <code>ERR-9041</code> or account numbers).</p><p class=\"text-pretty\">Combining <strong>BM25 keyword search</strong> with <strong>dense vector embeddings</strong> (e.g. <code>bge-large-en</code> or <code>nomic-embed-text</code>) ensures both semantic comprehension and exact lexical precision:</p><div class=\"code-block relative my-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm group\">\n<div class=\"code-block-header flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">python</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded transition-colors\" data-code=\"def%20hybrid_score(dense_score%3A%20float%2C%20sparse_score%3A%20float%2C%20alpha%3A%20float%20%3D%200.65)%20-%3E%20float%3A%0A%20%20%20%20%22%22%22%0A%20%20%20%20Combines%20dense%20semantic%20similarity%20with%20sparse%20keyword%20matching.%0A%20%20%20%20alpha%20balances%20semantic%20context%20vs%20keyword%20rigidity.%0A%20%20%20%20%22%22%22%0A%20%20%20%20return%20(alpha%20*%20dense_score)%20%2B%20((1.0%20-%20alpha)%20*%20sparse_score)\" data-i18n-aria=\"copyCode\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span data-copy-label>Copy</span></button>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark shiki-pre\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hybrid_score</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dense_score: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, sparse_score: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, alpha: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.65</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -&gt; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    Combines dense semantic similarity with sparse keyword matching.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    alpha balances semantic context vs keyword rigidity.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (alpha </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dense_score) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sparse_score)</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><h3 id=\"2-high-performance-local-inference-with-ollama\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>2. High-Performance Local Inference with Ollama</span><a href=\"#2-high-performance-local-inference-with-ollama\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">For local deployment on consumer workstations (such as an <strong>RTX 3070 8 GB VRAM + Ryzen 7 3700X + 32 GB DDR4-3600</strong> rig), pairing <strong>Ollama</strong> with quantized GGUF weights (<code>Q4_K_M</code>) and strict VRAM tuning delivers fast, deterministic execution:</p><ul>\n<li><strong>Role-Based Qwen 3.5 &amp; Qwen3-Coder Routing</strong>: Use <code>qwen3.5:9b</code> (<code>5.3 GiB</code> + <code>880 MiB</code> multimodal projector) for grounded synthesis inside 8 GB VRAM, derive a zero-thinking <code>qwen3.5-fast:9b</code> Modelfile (<code>temperature 0.1</code>) sharing the exact same disk blobs (<code>0 B</code> extra) for fast extraction and query rewriting, and offload sparse MoE <code>qwen3-coder:30b</code> (<code>3.3B</code> active) across GPU + 32 GB RAM for heavy code reasoning.</li>\n<li><strong>8 GB VRAM Guardrails</strong>: Enable <code>OLLAMA_VULKAN=0</code> (native CUDA), <code>OLLAMA_FLASH_ATTENTION=1</code>, <code>OLLAMA_KV_CACHE_TYPE=q8_0</code>, and <code>OLLAMA_NUM_PARALLEL=1</code> to fit <code>32K</code> context windows without multi-slot VRAM spikes.</li>\n<li><strong>Session Warmth on HDD/NVMe Storage</strong>: Set <code>OLLAMA_KEEP_ALIVE=30m</code> and <code>OLLAMA_MAX_LOADED_MODELS=2</code> to keep active models warm even when <code>OLLAMA_MODELS</code> resides on a secondary archive drive.</li>\n</ul><div class=\"code-block relative my-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm group\">\n<div class=\"code-block-header flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">bash</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded transition-colors\" data-code=\"%23%20Serve%20Qwen%203.5%209B%20on%20CUDA%20with%20Flash%20Attention%2C%20q8_0%20KV%20cache%2C%20and%2032K%20context%0AOLLAMA_VULKAN%3D0%20OLLAMA_FLASH_ATTENTION%3D1%20OLLAMA_KV_CACHE_TYPE%3Dq8_0%20OLLAMA_NUM_PARALLEL%3D1%20%5C%0A%20%20ollama%20run%20qwen3.5%3A9b%20--verbose\" data-i18n-aria=\"copyCode\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span data-copy-label>Copy</span></button>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark shiki-pre\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Serve Qwen 3.5 9B on CUDA with Flash Attention, q8_0 KV cache, and 32K context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">OLLAMA_VULKAN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OLLAMA_FLASH_ATTENTION</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OLLAMA_KV_CACHE_TYPE</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">q8_0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OLLAMA_NUM_PARALLEL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  ollama</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> qwen3.5:9b</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --verbose</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><h3 id=\"3-re-ranking-the-critical-quality-filter\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>3. Re-Ranking: The Critical Quality Filter</span><a href=\"#3-re-ranking-the-critical-quality-filter\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h3><p class=\"text-pretty\">The difference between mediocre RAG and enterprise-grade RAG is the <strong>Re-ranker</strong> stage (such as <code>bge-reranker-large</code>). </p><ol>\n<li>Fetch top 30 candidate chunks via fast hybrid search.</li>\n<li>Pass query and chunk pairs through the cross-encoder re-ranker.</li>\n<li>Supply only the top 3-5 highest-scoring contexts to the generator prompt.</li>\n</ol><p class=\"text-pretty\">This dramatically reduces hallucination while keeping context windows compact and inference speeds high.</p><h2 id=\"production-takeaways\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Production Takeaways</span><a href=\"#production-takeaways\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Evaluate on domain-specific gold sets</strong>: Track Recall@K and Faithfulness metrics systematically.</li>\n<li><strong>Small models, good context</strong>: A well-retrieved context fed to a <code>9B</code> local model consistently outperforms a massive model fed noisy context.</li>\n<li><strong>Cache embeddings aggressively</strong>: Embedding generation is deterministic; never re-embed unchanged documents.</li>\n<li><strong>Explore Related Blueprints</strong>: Compare this local LLM pipeline with <a href=\"/blog/ragon-air-gapped-zero-leak-rag-studio\" class=\"font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline\"><code>RagOn</code> (sub-2ms <code>$0</code> air-gapped BM25 + 3-gram RAG)</a> and our full <a href=\"/blog/local-ai-coding-stack-ollama-opencode-qwen3\" class=\"font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline\">Local AI Coding Stack with Ollama, OpenCode &amp; Qwen 3.5</a>.</li>\n</ul>"}
